{"ts":"2026-08-11T20:50:17.622Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"09d99a3d99ca542892066fe0","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-m0b7h8"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Linked-test removal must be lossless and observable for commands containing comma or equals delimiters"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"GitHub #982 proves pm test --add-json can persist a command containing comma and equals characters that pm test --remove cannot later address. The remove selector is reparsed as structured CSV, silently matches nothing, and returns ok:true without a removed count. This creates stale evidence that cannot be repaired through the supported CLI. All-status exact and conjunctive searches for linked-test removal, delimiter-safe selectors, comma/equals commands, and no-op removal found no canonical owner."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:cli","area:sdk","contracts","linked-tests","lossless-mutation","safety","token-efficiency"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-11T20:50:17.622Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-11T20:50:17.622Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Every linked-test command accepted by --add or --add-json can be removed losslessly even when it contains comma or equals characters; Removal reports an explicit removed count and a zero-match selector never returns an indistinguishable success receipt; A stable index selector addresses the 1-based --list order without reparsing stored command text; CLI SDK MCP help contracts completions and docs expose one shared selector contract; Focused integration packaged npm npx bun bunx exact 100/100/100/100 coverage docstring and static gates pass"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"project management = context management"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Make linked-test evidence fully reversible and make no-op mutations machine-observable"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Agents can repair stale test evidence without hand-editing tracker files or trusting false-success receipts"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Linked-test mutation becomes lossless across CLI SDK and MCP consumers"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The current published package can create evidence it cannot remove and silently reports success while leaving it stale"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-mpbb"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":98},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/reporter","value":"GitHub #982"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/environment","value":"@unbrained/pm-cli 2026.8.7 through 2026.8.11 Node 22/26 Linux"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Add a linked test command name=x,result=pass with pm test --add-json then remove it by command value; observe ok:true and the entry remains"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"The exact entry is removed or the command returns a typed zero-match refusal with removed=0"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"The selector is split at delimiters no entry matches and the mutation reports ok:true with no observable removal count"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-0v9k","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-11T20:50:17.622Z","author":"harness:codex","so